X3 AP is a very immersive 3d sandbox space combat and trading sim. I would strongly suggest X3 Rebalancing Mod if you are bored with the original.
PROs:
- you can pilot every ship, but not all of them are easy to obtain;
- you can trade, create your own factories both to make money and to produce weapons/ammunition you don't have enough of;
- you can control more than one ship - to me personally piloting a large ship and then leaving it on a small fighter to dogfight and then coming back is just.. cool :)
- things keep happening in systems where you are not present, i.e your ships still carry cargo or can get destroyed.
CONs:
- you can't change anything in the sandbox from within it - everything you kill will quite quickly return, and most of the stations you can't kill at all;
- there is no goal in the game - the journey to a large ship, large fleet, lots of money IS the game, there is no "endgame" afterwards (see first con);
- the UI is pretty bloated and doesn't pause the game in some places where it really should (i.e. boarding operations);
- the "out-of-sector" combat (when you are not present in the system) is atrocious and its results are nothing like what you would see if you were there (and NOT in your favor :) )
Overall, good game, 250+ hours of fun, recommended. Unfortunate that it did not quite get the polish it deserved.

